From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:38:06 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246: Wake on
 a double tap
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The touchscreen sits on the panel. Have it follow the panel, so that it
stops reporting while the screen is off and wakes it on a double tap
instead, from suspend too.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts     | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
index 2f027e63f..5060237f9 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6450-sony-xperia-columbia-pdx246.dts
@@ -763,6 +763,9 @@ touchscreen@38 {
 
 		touchscreen-size-x = <1080>;
 		touchscreen-size-y = <2520>;
+
+		panel = <&panel>;
+		wakeup-source;
 	};
 };
 
@@ -779,7 +782,7 @@ &mdss_dsi0 {
 
 	status = "okay";
 
-	panel@0 {
+	panel: panel@0 {
 		compatible = "samsung,sofef01-m-ams605dk01";
 		reg = <0>;
 
